  "details": "I always play with \"Forced\" setting on the \"Forced Camera Near Distance\" menu, and I have the habit of setting that in the moment I log in the game, before even joining anyone.\n\nRecently I noticed, that this setting stopped saving between worlds, despite in the menu saying, that the setting is set to \"Forced\". \n\nWhen changed to other value, and then back to \"Forced\", it reapplies the values.\n\nPlease, if you don't plan to make the setting save permanently - at least keep it save between game launches.",
